<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oTarget<dd>The object to unregister from<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oListener<dd>The object to unregister as a listener<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nEventType<dd>The event type to unregister for
